/metadata-codelist/DegreeOfConformity/conformant"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b10n3","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2009/976/oj"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b11n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Address","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#locality":"Göteborg","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#postal-code":"411 04","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#street-address":"Gullbergs strandgata 15"},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b12n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46106986000"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b1n0","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasValue":{"@id":"tel:+46106986000"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b2n0","@type":"dct:ProvenanceStatement","dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Geodata in the Spatial regulations for fisheries (including for recreational fisheries) has been digitalized from national regulations in Sweden. Even some EU delegated regulations that affect anglers are included. Geodata has been produced in the QGIS and FME programs. The Spatial regulations for fisheries (including for recreational fisheries)are updated regularly, in conjunction with changes to the laws and regulations that are digitized in the dataset. New publications of the Spatial regulations for fisheries (including for recreational fisheries) are generally released several times each year.\n\nThe geographical descriptions that have been digitized can be based on coordinates (points), but can also refer to different administrative boundaries and depth information. Some references point towards local landmarks and buildings. These references are very old, and all geodata that has been digitized from references without coordinates contain uncertainty.\n\nThe dataset Spatial regulations for fisheries (including for recreational fisheries) is not binding in a court of law, and it is always the source documents that are legally binding."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Geografisk information i Fiskets geografier har digitaliserats från nationella föreskrifter som reglerar fiske i Sverige. Även vissa EU-förordningar (som oftast berör fritidsfiske i svenskt vatten) har digitaliserats. Områden har skapats i programmet QGIS eller FME. Fiskets geografier uppdateras med nya publiceringar i samband med ändringar till lagar och föreskrifter som ingår i informationsmängden. I regel sker nya publiceringar flera gånger per år. \n\nGeografiska beskrivningar kan vara angivna som geografiska koordinater (punkter) eller referera till olika gränser och djupangivelser (linjer). Det förekommer också hänvisningar till landskapsformationer eller byggnader. Många geografiska beskrivningar är mycket gamla och refererar till landmärken eller naturliga formationer, utan att ange koordinater. Ytorna som bygger på icke-koordinatsatta geografiska beskrivningar håller inte en bra kvalitet och bör betraktas som osäkra. \n\nGeografierna i Fiskets geografier är inte rättsverkande, och det är alltid EU förordningen, föreskriften eller annan lagstiftningen som gäller i domstolen."}]},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b3n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((9.51 69.51,25.51 69.51,25.51 54.51,9.51 54.51,9.51 69.51))"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b4n0","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPlan":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b4n3"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b4n1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generated":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b4n2"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAssociation":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b4n0"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b4n2","dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/DegreeOfConformity/conformant"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b4n3","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2010/1089/oj"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b5n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((9.51 69.51,25.51 69.51,25.51 54.51,9.51 54.51,9.51 69.51))"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b6n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Attribution","dcat:hadRole":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResponsiblePartyRole/owner"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#agent":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006420"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b7n0","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#hadPlan":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b7n3"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b7n1","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Activity","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#generated":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b7n2"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#qualifiedAssociation":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b7n0"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b7n2","dct:type":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/DegreeOfConformity/conformant"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b7n3","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Plan","http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom":{"@id":"http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2009/976/oj"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b8n0","@type":"dct:Location","dcat:bbox":{"@type":"http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#wktLiteral","@value":"POLYGON((9.51 69.51,25.51 69.51,25.51 54.51,9.51 54.51,9.51 69.51))"}},{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b9n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Attribution","dcat:hadRole":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResponsiblePartyRole/owner"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#agent":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006420"}},{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006420","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:identifier":"2021006420","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/NationalAuthority"},"foaf:mbox":{"@id":"mailto:havochvatten@havochvatten.se"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Havs- och Vattenmyndigheten"},"foaf:page":{"@id":"https://www.havochvatten.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#sameAs":{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/1"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/192","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Havs- och vattenmyndigheten","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasAddress":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b0n0"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":{"@id":"mailto:havochvatten@havochvatten.se"},"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasTelephone":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b1n0"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/205","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/248"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/219"},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/220"},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/265"},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/267"}],"dcat:keyword":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Fishing"},{"@language":"en","@value":"Inspire"},{"@language":"en","@value":"open data"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Inspire"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Protected areas"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Regulation"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"fiske"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"reglering"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"skyddade områden"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"öppna data"}],"dcat:theme":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/theme/am"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/AGRI"},{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"}],"dcat:version":"2025-09-25","dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-right/PUBLIC"},"dct:alternative":{"@language":"en","@value":"Spatial regulations for fisheries (including for recreational fisheries)"},"dct:conformsTo":[{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/3035"},{"@id":"http://www.opengis.net/def/crs/EPSG/0/4326"}],"dct:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"The dataset describes areas in Sweden where fishing is regulated by national regulations: Skagerrak, Kattegatt, the Baltic Sea, and Sweden's largest lakes, rivers and canals. Even some areas from EU-delegated regulations (often those affecting anglers) are included. \nNew publications of the Spatial regulations for fisheries (including for recreational fisheries) are generally released several times each year. \nThe dataset Spatial regulations for fisheries (including for recreational fisheries) is not binding in a court of law, and it is always the source documents that are legally binding."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Datamängden beskriver områden som regleras av föreskrifter för fritids- som yrkesmässigt fiske i Skagerrak, Kattegatt och Östersjön, samt i Sveriges sjöar, vattendrag och kanaler. Vissa EU-förordningar som även berör fritidsfiske inkluderas också i datamängden. \nFiskets geografier uppdateras med nya publiceringar i samband med ändringar till lagar och föreskrifter som ingår i informationsmängden. I regel sker nya publiceringar flera gånger per år. \nGeografierna i Fiskets geografier är inte rättsverkande, och det är alltid EU förordningen, föreskriften eller annan lagstiftning som gäller i domstolen."}],"dct:identifier":"a783ff94-0408-402e-885b-1441e628b44d","dct:isPartOf":{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/34/resource/10"},"dct:language":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/SWE"},"dct:modified":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2026-04-02"},"dct:provenance":{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b2n0"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"http://dataportal.se/organisation/SE2021006420"},"dct:spatial":[{"@id":"_:5399652a3a9b84c5e66bfdd1ce020ac1806ae0b6550fbb913134e16ef333da4d_b3n0"},{"@id":"http://sws.geonames.org/2661886"}],"dct:subject":[{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/inlandWaters"},{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/TopicCategory/oceans"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/14933"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2534"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/2944"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/3256"},{"@id":"http://www.eionet.europa.eu/gemet/concept/3261"}],"dct:title":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Fiskets geografier"},"foaf:page":[{"@id":"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%253A02017R0118-20220711"},{"@id":"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/SV/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32022R0303&qid=1657265188394"},{"@id":"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/SV/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32022R2090"},{"@id":"https://www.havochvatten.se/data-kartor-och-rapporter/kartor-och-gis/karttjanster/karttjanster-fran-oss/fiskets-geografier/geodata-fiskets-geografier.html"},{