 myndigheter, kommuner, vattenvårdsförbund och liknande. Uppdraget att samla datamängden i ett datavärdskap inrättades ursprungligen av Naturvårdsverket."}},{"@id":"_:f2a7c8dda537e263f03cd1f43e25d44cf9e141f1a3e74665636e9f6087881e6d_b1n0","@type":"dct:PeriodOfTime","dcat:startDate":{"@type":"xsd:dateTime","@value":"1951-10-24T23:00:00.000Z"}},{"@id":"_:f2a7c8dda537e263f03cd1f43e25d44cf9e141f1a3e74665636e9f6087881e6d_b2n0","@type":"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Attribution","dcat:hadRole":{"@id":"http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/metadata-codelist/ResponsiblePartyRole/custodian"},"http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#agent":{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/166"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/166","@type":"foaf:Agent","dct:type":{"@id":"http://purl.org/adms/publishertype/Academia-ScientificOrganisation"},"foaf:name":{"@language":"sv","@value":"Sveriges Lantbruksuniversitet (SLU)"}},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/498","@type":"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#Organization","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#fn":"Datavärdskapet Provfiske: Elprovfiske","http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#hasEmail":[{"@id":"mailto:SERS@slu.se"},{"@id":"mailto:datavard-fisk@slu.se"}]},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/499","@type":"dcat:Dataset","dcat:contactPoint":{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/498"},"dcat:distribution":[{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/500"},{"@id":"https://metadata.havochvatten.se/store/1/resource/504"}],"dcat:keyword":["Sveriges Lantbruksuniversitet (SLU)",{"@language":"sv","@value":"datavärdskap"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"elprovfiske"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"vattendrag"}],"dcat:landingPage":{"@id":"https://www.slu.se/institutioner/akvatiska-resurser/databaser/"},"dcat:theme":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/data-theme/ENVI"},"dct:accessRights":{"@id":"http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/access-rig